title: '`pallet-broker`: reject zero `region_length` in config validation'

doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |
      `ConfigRecord::validate` rejected a zero `leadin_length` but accepted a zero
      `region_length`, which livelocks the sale: regions become empty and `do_purchase`
      always fails `TooEarly`. Zero `region_length` is now rejected with `InvalidConfig`.
      Note this guards the `configure` call; genesis config is not validated.

crates:
  - name: pallet-broker
    bump: none
